      <li>注重科研数据传输的安全性</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"feature-card\">\n                <h3>节点优化</h3>\n                <ul>\n                    <li>提供多地理位置线路供选择</li>\n                    <li>适用于全球科研协作场景</li>\n                    <li>定期节点更新以保持最佳速度</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"feature-card\">\n                <h3>服务理念</h3>\n                <ul>\n                    <li>以科研工作者为核心</li>\n                    <li>提供透明的使用指引</li>\n                    <li>注重长期稳定性而非短期表现</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"plans-section\">\n            <h2>阶梯式套餐方案</h2>\n            <div class=\"plan-container\">\n                <div class=\"plan-card\">\n                    <div class=\"plan-header\">基础版</div>\n                    <div class=\"plan-content\">\n                        <div class=\"plan-price\">\n                            ¥15<span class=\"annual\">/月</span><br>\n                            <span class=\"annual\">按年付仅需 ¥150/年</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <ul class=\"plan-features\">\n                            <li>每月100GB高速流量</li>\n                            <li>支持3台设备同时在线</li>\n                            <li>解锁基础流媒体平台</li>\n                            <li>普通线路节点池</li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"plan-card plan-featured\">\n                    <div class=\"plan-header\">旗舰版</div>\n                    <div class=\"plan-content\">\n                        <div class=\"plan-price\">\n                            ¥35<span class=\"annual\">/月</span><br>\n                            <span class=\"annual\">按年付仅需 ¥350/年</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <ul class=\"plan-features\">\n                            <li>每月300GB高速流量</li>\n                            <li>支持5台设备同时在线</li>\n         